	"Description": "[list=1]\n<br />[*]This greenhouse is mainly designed for growing rice. You can walk through the pebbled area in the water zone, and the lower water area is swimmable — see the images for details.\n<br />[*]A greenhouse map made specifically for rice cultivation, with seasonal changes.\n<br />[*]Only spring, summer, and fall are included. In winter, the map uses spring tiles since snow inside a greenhouse felt too out of place.\u00A0\n<br />[*]The perimeter strip can be planted on too — in fact, almost the entire first floor of the greenhouse is plantable. For decoration, just lay down some flooring.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[/list]",
